# vision/ rules

- Mode 2 is a stretch goal. Do not let vision work block Mode 1.
- Ultralytics YOLO with ByteTrack (`tracker="bytetrack.yaml"`), device `mps` when available. Log measured FPS.
- Output `TargetSet` (top 4 tracked objects with stable ids) from `shared/protocol.py`.
- Visual servoing outputs only a desired turn/forward suggestion; control/ decides and can always STOP.
- Lost track, low confidence or stale frame -> no suggestion (control treats as STOP).
- Weights files (`*.pt`) are gitignored; document the model name in the folder README.
